#: ../../../reference/accessibility/dbus/org.a11y.atspi.Socket.md:20
msgid ""
"This is the entry point for an application that wants to register itself "
"against the accessibility registry. The application\\'s root object, which "
"it passes in `plug`, must support the org.a11y.atspi.Application interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/dbus/org.a11y.atspi.Socket.md:25
msgid ""
"When an application calls this method on the registry, the following "
"handshake happens:"
